PNG-SPEC v1.2 HIGH-FIDELITY
Canvas: 2400x1600 px
Background: Transparent
Stroke: 4px Black
Font: Inter-SemiBold 32px White

Layers:
  L0: Coordinate Frame
  L1: Smooth Side (Left)
    - Manifold M
    - Smooth map f: M → N
  L2: Discrete Side (Right)
    - Graph F(M)
    - Graph morphism F(f)
  L3: Functor Arrow
    - Large horizontal arrow labeled "F"
    - 8px stroke, bright blue (#00A0FFFF)
  L4: Labels
    - "F(M)" above graph
    - "F(f)" above graph morphism
    - "Functor F : Smooth → Discrete"
  L5: Annotation Overlay
    - Text: "F preserves composition: F(f ∘ g) = F(f) ∘ F(g)"

Export:
  PNG (RGBA)
